          "published_at": "2026-10-28T10:54:51.295Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/thorstenball/status/2115396872755876148",
          "topic": "AI inference economics",
          "text": "People have been saying this for a year now.\n\nBeware of the great rug pull, etc.\n\nBut all indications point towards price/intelligence dropping. Ant's S-1 says subs are 10% of rev. Inference has 80% margins.\n\nWhy should this happen?",
          "quote_tweet": {
            "url": "https://x.com/zachmoskow/status/2115244246206754877",
            "published_at": "2026-10-28T00:48:22.290Z",
            "author": {
              "name": "Zach Moskow",
              "handle": "zachmoskow"
            },
            "text": "it's gonna be hilarious when everyone looks back 6 months from now and remembers getting $5K in inference for $200 a month...",
            "media": []
          },
          "author_replies": [],
